{"id":"8d8851700a6e1ac3","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-resolvent.md","title":"Resolvent","display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-resolvent","aliases":["58-df-resolvent"],"display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent","depends_on":["[[58-df-resolvent-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-resolvent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-resolvent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolvent — Resolvent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"58-df-resolvent-set\">58-df-resolvent-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda,R\\in V\">\\(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\)</span> (unital Banach-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"58-df-resolvent-set\">58-df-resolvent-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\)</span> (invertibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"58-df-resolvent-set\">58-df-resolvent-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_A(x)\">\\(\\rho_A(x)\\)</span> (resolvent set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"58-df-resolvent-set\">58-df-resolvent-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)\\)</span> (resolvent-element graph predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\land\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\land R\\in A\\land(\\lambda1_A-x)\\cdot R=1_A=R\\cdot(\\lambda1_A-x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\land\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\land R\\in A\\land(\\lambda1_A-x)\\cdot R=1_A=R\\cdot(\\lambda1_A-x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a bounded operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> on a complex Banach space, take <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathcal B(X)\">\\(A=\\mathcal B(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=T\">\\(x=T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The operator-theoretic boundedness of the inverse is then automatic because invertibility is taken inside the Banach algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-resolvent-set","status":"resolved","id":"59c5498c726aa6df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-resolvent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-resolvent-set","status":"resolved","id":"59c5498c726aa6df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)$ (unital Banach-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-resolvent-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-resolvent-set","status":"resolved","id":"59c5498c726aa6df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)$ (invertibility predicate, see [[58-df-resolvent-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-resolvent-set","status":"resolved","id":"59c5498c726aa6df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\rho_A(x)$ (resolvent set, see [[58-df-resolvent-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\bigl(\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ResolventElement}_S(R;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\land\\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\land R\\in A\\land(\\lambda1_A-x)\\cdot R=1_A=R\\cdot(\\lambda1_A-x)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\mathcal B(X)","display":false},{"tex":"x=T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1475,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1086","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-resolvent.md|58-df-resolvent]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["59c5498c726aa6df"]}